<item><title>Railway Drain Stromwater Treatment</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract is for the Construction of a stormwater treatment device within the railway drain in the township of Rangiora.<br /><br />The main tasks involved in this Contract are:<br /><br />- Supply and install 3.35 x 5.18m by 3.325m deep Baffle Box (stormwater treatment<br /><br />device) – note dimensions may vary depending on production of final shop drawings<br /><br />by Atlan Stromwater<br /><br />- Supply and install diversion weir and new 1.5x0.5m (internal span) concrete channel<br /><br />to and from the baffle box.<br /><br />- Reshaping and cleaning of the existing drain<br /><br />- Installation of rock rip rap<br /><br />- Design and build of bespoke safety grilles at drain inlet and outlet<br /><br />- Design and build of bespoke channel sections<br /><br />- Car park and garden beds reinstatement<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Nov/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2714<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=914df6bde28c42acad112e9d0133ef16s2714</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">914df6bde28c42acad112e9d0133ef16</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:39:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
<category>Water &amp; Sewage</category>
</item>
<item><title>25/119 Rangiora Airfield Internal Water &amp; Wastewater Servicing</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Supply and installation of:<br /><br />o 966 metres of 63mm OD PN12.5 PE100 watermain.<br /><br />o 1431 metres of 63mm OD PN16 PE100 pressure sewer main.<br /><br />o 206 metres of 40mm OD PN16 PE100 pressure sewer main.<br /><br />o Installation of power cable and associated electrical works<br /><br />- Supply and installation details as shown in the drawings.<br /><br />- Supply and installation of three new LPSS pumpstations<br /><br />- Supply and installation of soakage pits and other drainage works<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Nov/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2713<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
