<category>Water &amp; Sewage</category>
</item>
<item><title>26/72 - Broad Road Seal Extension</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The procurement includes all labour, plant, materials, traffic management and construction activities necessary to deliver the Broad Road Seal Extension project.<br /><br />The project includes the widening and seal extension on a section of Broad Road (Separable Portion A) and Rangiora Leithfield Road (Separable Portion B) in Sefton. The precise location of the works is as follows:<br /><br />Separable Portion A<br /><br />•	Broad Road seal extension from RP 5137m to approximately RP 4327 m (approximately 810 m).<br /><br />Separable Portion B <br /><br />•	Remaining Broad Road seal extension from approximately RP 4327 m to RP 4137 m (approximately 190 m).<br /><br />•	Rangiora Leithfield Road seal extension from RP 5965 m to RP 6475 m (approximately 510 m).<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 11/Nov/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2706<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
