<item><title>26/70 - Gladstone Bore 3 - Drilling Contract</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract is for the drilling, development, testing and capping of one (1) new potable water supply bore for the Woodend-Pegasus drinking water supply. The location of the bore is shown in the locality plan in Appendix A.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 11/Nov/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2704<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Mining & Quarrying & Oil & Gas, Utilities<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
